    "location": "html-block:73",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "Vamp Arc Protection Relay System"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:74",
    "text": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:75",
    "text": "Schneider Electric VAMP range is an arc flash detection and protection pioneer offering fast and reliable devices to improve safety with close to 10,000 arc flash systems in service worldwide, ranging from single arc protection units to multi-zone arc flash systems.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:76",
    "text": "An arc flash is a mass of heat and pressure caused by a switchgear fault, not only does it cause power outages but it can also result in loss of business, extensive material damage and can seriously jeopardize the safety of operational staff. VAMP’s arc detection and protection system measures fault current and light via arc sensor channels and should a fault occur, minimizes burning time by quickly cutting off the current feeding the arc. Traditional arc protection methods do not provide fast enough protection and short arc burning times are critical, especially when the arc develops during maintenance work on the switchgear, jeopardizing personal safely and life. The unique arc fault functionality adds a new dimension to the total safety of the installation and the reliability of the power system protection. Secure your assets, the safety of staff and the future of your power system today with VAMP’s ultra-fast arc protection products.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:77",
    "text": "The latest offering from Schneider Electric is the innovative VAMP 321. Combining the reliable technology of the VAMP 50 and 200 series and that of the VAMP 221 arc flash protection system, the VAMP 321 offers a safe and technologically advanced solution for protection and control, in just one product.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:78",
    "text": "Total fault clearing time typically:",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:79",
    "text": "Outgoing feeder 50 (relay) + 60 (CB)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:80",
    "text": "= 110 ms (+ Auto-reclosing)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:81",
    "text": "Incoming feeder 350 (relay)+ 60 (CB)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:82",
    "text": "= 410 ms",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:83",
    "text": "Resistance Earthed Network",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:84",
    "text": "Earth-fault relay operation times are typically",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:85",
    "text": "set high, thus burning times of high-impedance",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:86",
    "text": "type arc faults are prolonged.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:87",
    "text": "Typically the burning time of an arc fault should be limited to less than 100 ms in order to avoid major damage. Burning times of nearly half a second will most certainly cause considerable damage in the switchgear installation.",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:88",
    "text": "Total fault clearing time typically:",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:89",
    "text": "Outgoing/ingoing feeders 7 ms (relay) + 60 ms (CB)",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:90",
    "text": "= 67 ms",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:91",
    "text": "Resistance Earthed Network",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:92",
    "text": "Fault clearance in 57 - 67 ms",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:93",
    "text": "The conventional MV protection schemes have traditionally been complemented by implementing busbar differential schemes. The differential scheme implementations are typically expensive due to extra CT’s needed and complicated engineering and wiring. Busbar protection systems based on interlockings are slow, minimum operating time usually being 100 ms + CB time. A modern arc protection system provides though a very cost-effective high-speed busbar protection for air insulated MV switchgears. Standard Manufacturers Warranty: 2 years",
    "heading": "Features"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:94",
    "text": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:95",
    "text": "Personnel safety",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:96",
    "text": "Fast and reliable arc protection systems improve safety and may save human lives in case of an arc fault arising in switchgear during work in or near the installation.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:97",
    "text": "Reduced loss of production",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:98",
    "text": "The faster the operating time of an arc protection system, the lesser the damage caused by the arc fault, reducing the possible outage of the power supply.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:99",
    "text": "Prolonged switchgear cycle",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:100",
    "text": "A modern arc protection system increases the life expectancy of switchgear installations, investment decisions in new switchgear installation can then be postponed and money saved by re-VAMPing the existing system.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:101",
    "text": "Reduced insurance costs",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:102",
    "text": "The faster and better the protection system, the more generous the insurance terms and lower the cost should be.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:103",
    "text": "Low investment costs and fast installation",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:104",
    "text": "A comprehensive arc protection is characterized by low investment, fast installation and commissioning time. One successful operation of the arc protection system provides immediate return on investment.",
    "heading": "Benefits"
  },
  {
